&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:10.6pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6.1pt;line-height:7pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:6pt;"&gt;・CO2排出量削減目標を設定し、排出量削減の取り組みを計画的に実行&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.6pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6.1pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:7pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:6pt;"&gt;・更なる省エネ・再エネ化の促進、グリーン電力証書の購入&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:10.6pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6.1pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:7pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:6pt;"&gt;・高効率空調機、高断熱材の導入、全照明のLED化、自家発電（太陽光発電やバイオマス電量発電）の余剰電力利用等による電力消費量削減&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:18.1pt;min-height:18.1pt;"&gt;
